WEBVTT

00:00:00.683 --> 00:00:01.350
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.735 --> 00:00:04.194
<v><b>Daisy:</b></v> We need to talk.

00:00:04.765 --> 00:00:06.566
<v><b>Sam:</b></v> Talk? What about?

00:00:07.269 --> 00:00:08.010
<v><b>Daisy:</b></v> Us.

00:00:09.866 --> 00:00:10.461
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:11.737 --> 00:00:12.985
<v><b>Sam:</b></v> Listen to me, Daisy.

00:00:14.921 --> 00:00:15.677
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:17.054 --> 00:00:19.721
<v><b>Sam:</b></v> I love you. Do you love me?

00:00:21.663 --> 00:00:22.369
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:26.358
<v><b>Daisy:</b></v> I like Paul, but I don’t love him.

00:00:28.274 --> 00:00:29.023
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:30.197 --> 00:00:32.120
<v><b>Director:</b></v> Great! I like it.

00:00:34.095 --> 00:00:34.906
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:38.682
<v><b>Director:</b></v> Go to the windows. Open them.